{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493910/extras/AboutGameGif.gif?t=1743494167\" /><strong>Eldritch Exterminators</strong> is a bullet heaven rogue-lite where heroes don\u2019t exist\u2014just guns. Wield a possessed infernal weapon and unleash chaos on endless hordes of Elder God minions. Master a deep upgrade system, forging devastating builds with soul-shredding firepower. Your mission? Slay an Eldritch God and break free from its cursed grip. Do you have the grit to break free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493910/extras/Incoming.gif?t=1743494167\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493910/extras/FeaturesGif.gif?t=1743494167\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INFERNAL ARMAMENTS</strong> | Unleash chaos as the embodiment of a Gun, laying waste to hordes with a hail of bullets! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SOULS </strong>| Embody the tormented souls consumed by the Eldritch Gods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RUNES </strong>| Experiment with ancient runes and strategically customize your playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>REVELATIONS </strong>| Unveil an extensive array of Guns, Souls, Abilities, and Runes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRIBULATIONS </strong>| Confront harrowing challenges and test your mettle against the true might of the Eldritch Gods! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARTIFACTS </strong>| Discover a variety of artifacts that offer unique properties, not just stats.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493910/extras/ArtifactsFrames.gif?t=1743494167\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493910/extras/Roadmap_Frames.gif?t=1743494167\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 18 Armaments, each with a variation mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 enemies and 10 unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 6 Maps with their unique challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> More build diversity, summons, <span class=\"bb_strike\">ricochets</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">orbitals</span>, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple layers of meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 30 different Souls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 different Runes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> UI/SFX/UX Polish  </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dretch Bane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2493910/0dccd0b79ab3119d2fb50d488da085d16fc45d63.jpg"},{"name":"Adiras\u2019 Wrath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2493910/80b5a76c264163fd92347ff9f7e13a7b8f060321.jpg"},{"name":"Madrugar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2493910/de38e6e2f36222251631519576983f906217f670.jpg"},{"name":"Shrike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2493910/72c7a15b34acb165999ab150f8c7640a30974750.jpg"},{"name":"Harrath's Peace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2493910/2db079b90e3a90e61765f49d7a2bfda0252705cd.jpg"},{"name":"Goruk's Doorbell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2493910/e233fa29c8f8082451fe34ae2e2a2e5d10caf12e.jpg"},{"name":"Soul of the Anchored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam